WEBVTT

00:20.880 --> 00:26.860
If I was dreaming, how did I forget?

00:26.920 --> 00:30.690
It pulsed through me, frigid, shocked me

00:30.690 --> 00:32.330
Can I do, do?

00:33.000 --> 00:38.000
I want you next to me when I summon you

00:39.170 --> 00:43.000
Waiting close by, but you seem far off

00:43.010 --> 00:45.340
Na, na, na, knight

00:45.340 --> 00:48.510
The more beautiful the rose

00:48.510 --> 00:51.480
The more its thorns hurt

00:51.480 --> 00:54.750
Now that I'm strong

00:54.750 --> 00:59.750
My heart knows to protect that vow

01:00.760 --> 01:03.790
Let's meet in the dark of night

01:03.790 --> 01:06.860
Where you're waiting

01:06.860 --> 01:09.860
You'll worship the cruel Dark Queen

01:09.870 --> 01:13.030
Who's drunk with danger

01:13.040 --> 01:16.000
You shattered the glass sword

01:16.000 --> 01:18.970
You wielded without thinking

01:18.970 --> 01:21.910
Its shards glow in the night

01:21.910 --> 01:25.380
I lick your wounded fingers

01:42.600 --> 01:46.550
Sasanaki Zoo

01:47.300 --> 01:48.400
What happened?

01:48.400 --> 01:52.040
Hey, what happened?

01:52.040 --> 01:54.280
Hey, what the heck happened?

01:54.910 --> 01:59.720
A maid broke into the cage
and took the panda with her.

02:07.260 --> 02:12.260
This would be the actor's third divorce.

02:13.260 --> 02:15.100
Here you go, Mistress.

02:15.100 --> 02:16.360
This would be the actor's third divorce.

02:16.370 --> 02:17.830
We're here live at Sasanaki Zoo where
the panda, Ryu-Ryu,

02:17.830 --> 02:21.570
No matter how many times I drink it,
your tea is always delicious, Sawawa.

02:21.870 --> 02:24.850
Thank you very much, Mistress.

02:24.910 --> 02:26.370
According to eye-witness reports,

02:26.380 --> 02:28.280
It would seem that the
suspect was dressed up as a maid.

02:28.280 --> 02:29.780
My younger sister has moved to our town.

02:32.480 --> 02:34.860
Princess Sherwood?

02:49.770 --> 02:54.870
Geez, where the heck did Francesca run off to
without taking care of my luggage?

02:55.770 --> 02:58.780
Why did she move here?

02:59.940 --> 03:02.880
It's because Sherwood and I
have formed an alliance.

03:02.880 --> 03:07.050
I assume she thought it would be for the best
if we lived near one another.

03:07.680 --> 03:09.820
Princess Sherwood, huh?

03:10.890 --> 03:13.630
She'll probably toy around with me again.

03:15.490 --> 03:18.660
What are you just sitting there for?
Hurry and go.

03:19.160 --> 03:21.530
Go? Where to?

03:21.530 --> 03:26.040
To congratulate Sherwood on moving
to her new mansion, of course.

03:26.700 --> 03:29.050
Congratulate her moving here?

03:30.640 --> 03:32.450
What else?

03:33.110 --> 03:34.750
What?!

03:35.710 --> 03:37.780
Sherwood's waiting for you.

03:37.780 --> 03:39.590
Good luck, Hiro.

03:40.250 --> 03:43.490
I'm busy training my soldiers.

03:43.690 --> 03:47.790
Give my regards to Sherwood
and Francesca, Hiro.

03:47.790 --> 03:49.600
Have a safe trip.

03:50.590 --> 03:52.230
Huga.

04:17.720 --> 04:21.760
What? A panda's gone missing from the zoo?

04:22.490 --> 04:24.470
What's that all about, I wonder?

04:25.960 --> 04:27.190
What the heck?

04:27.200 --> 04:28.500
That can't be real.

04:28.500 --> 04:30.310
It's a panda!

04:34.500 --> 04:37.070
Mom, there's a panda walking outside!

04:41.210 --> 04:44.190
So, this is Princess Sherwood's mansion

04:48.580 --> 04:50.220
Huga.

04:52.490 --> 04:54.300
A panda...

04:54.360 --> 04:55.990
Huga.

04:55.990 --> 04:58.090
Geez, you took your sweet time coming home.

04:58.090 --> 04:59.900
Where were...

05:00.460 --> 05:02.100
Huga.

05:15.910 --> 05:18.380
Would you mind telling me
what that is, Francesca?

05:18.380 --> 05:19.380
Huga.

05:19.380 --> 05:22.150
A panda? I can tell that just by looking!

05:22.150 --> 05:22.780
Huga.

05:24.120 --> 05:25.920
I didn't ask for his name!

05:25.920 --> 05:28.660
I want to know what the heck
a panda is doing here!

05:28.660 --> 05:29.660
Huga.

05:29.660 --> 05:30.660
What?

05:30.660 --> 05:34.300
Ryu-Ryu was transferred to Sasanaki Zoo
from another zoo

05:34.300 --> 05:37.640
and now he's lonely because
he misses his friends?

05:37.870 --> 05:39.530
Huga.

05:39.530 --> 05:43.340
So, you figured I'd be lonely living here
all alone in this big mansion,

05:43.340 --> 05:44.710
so you brought me a playmate?

05:44.710 --> 05:47.470
You idiot, don't do such unnecessary things!

05:47.480 --> 05:49.680
Take it back at once!

05:50.280 --> 05:51.920
Huga.

05:51.980 --> 05:54.250
What's this? You came to see me, Hiro.

05:54.250 --> 05:56.780
Well, Hime told me to.

05:56.790 --> 05:59.790
Ah, my sister's so thoughtful.

05:59.790 --> 06:01.990
She sent you here to
congratulate me on the move!

06:01.990 --> 06:04.470
Come, let's get started on cleaning the mansion!

06:06.930 --> 06:07.930
Huga.

06:07.930 --> 06:10.310
What? Is there something else?

06:11.530 --> 06:12.600
Huga.

06:12.600 --> 06:15.480
What? He'll do anything, just let him stay?

06:16.540 --> 06:17.640
Huga.

06:17.640 --> 06:21.380
He wants to work for me?
He wants to serve me?

06:21.380 --> 06:24.150
Maybe he likes you, Princess Sherwood.

06:25.480 --> 06:28.590
Sometimes being so charming has its problems.

06:30.520 --> 06:32.850
However, I'm the one who chooses my servants.

06:32.850 --> 06:35.160
I only allow those with the talent to do so
to serve me.

06:36.520 --> 06:38.460
Yes, talent.

06:38.460 --> 06:40.490
Hiro here has talent!

06:40.500 --> 06:43.900
Hiro put his life on the line to protect me.

06:43.900 --> 06:46.510
That's why I made him servant number one.

06:51.510 --> 06:53.540
Isn't that right, Hiro?

06:54.040 --> 06:56.980
Now, if you want to serve me,

06:56.980 --> 07:00.220
you'll need to show me that you
have the talent for it.

07:01.380 --> 07:02.450
Huga.

07:02.450 --> 07:05.760
You want a chance to show me that
you have the talent to be my servant?

07:08.690 --> 07:13.090
It would be a shame to send you back to your
tiny cage after bringing you here.

07:13.090 --> 07:16.040
All right, I'll allow you to stay for a little while.

07:20.340 --> 07:21.970
Are you sure this is okay?

07:21.970 --> 07:24.510
I'm a merciful person.

07:24.740 --> 07:29.140
No, I mean, shouldn't we take him
back to the zoo?

07:29.140 --> 07:32.450
He asked to stay and I said it's okay.

07:32.450 --> 07:35.050
I don't see any problem at all.

07:38.990 --> 07:40.990
Hey, don't get so close!
You're too warm.

08:13.050 --> 08:16.060
This was sent by the customer over there.

08:17.860 --> 08:21.570
Oh, thank you, you've made me so happy.

08:21.800 --> 08:26.540
And these are from this customer,
that customer and that one over there.

08:27.740 --> 08:29.720
And this here...

08:30.640 --> 08:32.450
...is from me.

08:36.680 --> 08:36.980
No Trespassing

08:36.980 --> 08:41.180
Listen up, some may call this training rote,

08:41.180 --> 08:45.650
but this is special training to be ready
in case the enemy comes attacking!

08:45.650 --> 08:47.630
Now, follow me!

08:53.360 --> 08:56.360
Where's your canine pride?!

08:56.360 --> 08:58.930
What happened to your fighting spirit?!

08:58.930 --> 09:01.300
Mom, what is she doing?

09:01.300 --> 09:03.110
Shh! Don't stare!

09:19.690 --> 09:22.290
Next, take those boxes upstairs.

09:22.960 --> 09:24.590
Yes, ma'am.

09:24.590 --> 09:26.230
All right...

09:33.200 --> 09:36.870
Well, if you're trying to show me your abilities,

09:36.870 --> 09:39.010
I can certainly see you have physical strength.

09:41.210 --> 09:43.690
However, it's nothing compared to Francesca.

09:52.490 --> 09:54.630
What the hell are you doing, you imbecile?!

09:55.560 --> 09:57.020
Francesca!

09:57.030 --> 09:58.660
Huga.

10:07.640 --> 10:09.000
Here you go.

10:09.000 --> 10:12.920
There was a bat flying around looking
for something before.

10:13.170 --> 10:16.780
Yeah, Reiri... I mean, that vampire...

10:16.780 --> 10:18.950
What is she up to this time?

10:18.950 --> 10:20.760
Reiri, huh?

10:21.650 --> 10:23.460
Never mind.

10:28.490 --> 10:30.970
What? Princess Shenuood?

10:31.730 --> 10:35.770
I see, she's moved to our town.

10:37.470 --> 10:40.300
Princess Sherwood is another member
of the Royal Family.

10:40.300 --> 10:43.580
I'd love to have a taste of her blood.

10:46.980 --> 10:50.220
Oh, how thoughtful, I'm grateful.

10:52.080 --> 10:53.880
What is it?

10:53.880 --> 10:58.290
What? You'll give me a shoulder massage?

10:58.290 --> 11:01.560
Well then, let's see how you do.

11:07.100 --> 11:08.960
Ouch!

11:08.960 --> 11:10.430
You clumsy fool!

11:10.430 --> 11:12.070
Francesca!

11:12.070 --> 11:13.700
Huga.

11:36.490 --> 11:39.470
Oh, your cooking is great, Francesca.

11:43.260 --> 11:45.070
What now?

11:45.070 --> 11:46.880
No thank you.

11:48.400 --> 11:50.210
I said, no thank you!

12:18.170 --> 12:20.530
Thanks for dinner, Princess Sherwood

12:20.540 --> 12:25.510
You can move out of my sister's place
and live with me, Hiro.

12:25.510 --> 12:28.340
You'll eat like a king every day!

12:28.340 --> 12:30.320
I'll think about it.

12:33.880 --> 12:35.520
Reiri!

12:36.780 --> 12:38.760
Nice to see you again, Hiro.

12:39.020 --> 12:41.520
A vampire, huh?

12:41.520 --> 12:42.620
Huga.

12:42.620 --> 12:45.790
This is the first time we meet,
Princess Sherwood.

12:45.790 --> 12:47.790
My name is Reiri Kamura.

12:47.800 --> 12:50.500
What could a vampire want with me?

12:50.500 --> 12:55.500
Your sister and I have a relationship.

12:55.640 --> 13:00.640
Out of respect for her,
I came to give you a warning,

13:00.910 --> 13:04.250
though it may be too late.

13:10.350 --> 13:12.020
Spiderbats, huh?

13:12.020 --> 13:13.690
Spiderbats?

13:13.690 --> 13:17.060
They're monsters that serve under vampires.

13:17.060 --> 13:21.800
So, that vampire is targeting me
for my royal blood?

13:24.270 --> 13:29.510
So, Reiri isn't just targeting Hime,
but Princess Sherwood, as well?

13:36.340 --> 13:39.310
Francesca and I are...

13:39.310 --> 13:41.190
...unbeatable...

13:42.550 --> 13:45.030
Ow, ow, ow...

13:46.490 --> 13:47.720
Get 'em!

13:47.720 --> 13:49.360
Huga.

13:58.200 --> 14:01.010
Are you going to protect me?

14:09.510 --> 14:10.840
Ryu-Ryu!

14:10.850 --> 14:14.020
I guess he won't cut it as my servant after all.

14:22.290 --> 14:24.100
How funny!

14:26.830 --> 14:29.000
Hiro's not back yet, huh?

14:29.000 --> 14:30.800
Nope, he's late.

14:30.800 --> 14:33.540
Maybe Princess Sherwood is
keeping him to herself.

14:36.470 --> 14:37.470
Huga.

14:37.470 --> 14:39.450
Damn, what did you come here for?

14:43.180 --> 14:47.550
Princess, are you sure it's all right to
not have a collar on your dog?

14:47.550 --> 14:49.360
What did you say?!

14:50.950 --> 14:53.730
Now is not the time for that.

14:55.220 --> 14:56.860
Princess,

14:57.730 --> 15:00.790
your beloved little sister is in trouble.

15:00.800 --> 15:01.900
What?!

15:01.900 --> 15:05.500
Reiri, why are you telling me this?

15:05.500 --> 15:07.370
What do you want?

15:07.370 --> 15:12.370
I don't want anything.

15:13.010 --> 15:17.980
Let's just say it's because I don't want anyone else
to have a taste of the royal blood.

15:31.090 --> 15:33.460
What a beautiful crescent moon.

15:33.460 --> 15:37.670
Dance for my entertainment,
while I enjoy this splendid wine.

15:43.340 --> 15:46.580
Seems I'm in for a lovely dream this evening.

15:48.080 --> 15:51.110
I'm really looking forward to seeing
just what flavor

15:52.850 --> 15:58.200
the youngest daughter of the
Royal Family's blood has in store.

16:10.530 --> 16:13.600
We keep killing and killing them,
but they keep coming!

16:14.700 --> 16:19.120
Maybe there's too many even for
the unbeatable Francesca.

17:02.450 --> 17:04.090
Huga.

17:24.370 --> 17:25.510
Ryu-Ryu!

17:25.510 --> 17:27.250
Oww...

17:32.510 --> 17:34.150
Ryu-Ryu...

17:41.790 --> 17:46.600
It's clear to me now that you had
the talent to be my servant.

17:57.640 --> 18:01.450
Now, time for the climax.

18:10.420 --> 18:11.890
What's this?

18:11.890 --> 18:14.230
The ensemble has been tousled.

18:20.260 --> 18:21.900
Hime!

18:22.060 --> 18:23.860
Sister...

18:23.860 --> 18:28.130
My, my, we have a special guest, it seems.

18:28.140 --> 18:29.770
Huga!

18:53.290 --> 18:56.140
Sister, why?

18:56.600 --> 18:59.070
What is it, Sherwood?

18:59.070 --> 19:01.430
Have you forgotten about our alliance?

19:01.440 --> 19:03.570
You really came to save me?

19:05.210 --> 19:07.710
I also wanted to congratulate you on moving.

19:07.710 --> 19:11.350
My soldiers, come show me
the results of your training!

19:12.450 --> 19:13.680
What the hell?!

19:13.680 --> 19:15.960
What happened to your canine pride?!

19:16.820 --> 19:19.320
Hime! This is Reiri's doing!

19:19.320 --> 19:20.920
This wasn't Reiri.

19:20.920 --> 19:24.960
There's more than one vampire in this town.

19:27.500 --> 19:31.140
My goodness, you had to go and ruin things.

19:43.980 --> 19:45.980
Daybreak...

19:45.980 --> 19:47.790
Does that means it's over?

19:49.220 --> 19:51.380
Did we get all of them?

19:51.390 --> 19:53.190
It seems so.

19:56.360 --> 19:58.340
What a nice corpse.

19:59.930 --> 20:03.730
All right, brave panda Ryu-Ryu,

20:03.730 --> 20:05.330
I shall accept you.

20:05.330 --> 20:09.680
You shall become my second servant
and serve me forever.

20:10.870 --> 20:14.910
The Royal Family has the power
to grant half-immortality.

20:19.850 --> 20:21.660
He's still alive?

20:22.850 --> 20:24.490
Huga.

20:26.650 --> 20:29.560
What? They missed the vital points?

20:29.560 --> 20:31.590
He's just knocked out?

20:33.860 --> 20:35.840
Wake up, Ryu-Ryu!

20:38.430 --> 20:40.070
My, my,

20:40.670 --> 20:44.550
you should save some fun for later.

20:45.270 --> 20:47.810
Oh, I see.

20:47.810 --> 20:50.140
I suppose I should be grateful to you, Ms. Reiri.

20:50.140 --> 20:52.720
Things are more exciting with you around.

20:53.610 --> 20:57.780
Ms. Hime rescued her sister when they're
supposed to be fighting for the throne.

20:57.790 --> 21:02.560
This just makes me want to taste
their blood even more.

21:05.360 --> 21:08.100
It was nice seeing you, Zeppeli.

21:08.560 --> 21:12.510
Goodnight, Ms. Reiri, sweet dreams.

21:24.410 --> 21:25.750
Good afternoon!

21:25.750 --> 21:27.730
You're late, Hiro.

21:31.590 --> 21:33.490
They're multiplying.

21:33.490 --> 21:35.360
Allow me to introduce them to you.

21:35.360 --> 21:39.160
These are the blood-brothers that Ryu-Ryu
made a vow to in the previous zoo,

21:39.160 --> 21:40.900
Kan-Kan and Cho-Cho.

21:43.960 --> 21:46.100
They are your little brothers now.

21:46.100 --> 21:48.200
Please look after them carefully, Hiro.

21:48.200 --> 21:49.840
What?!

21:58.380 --> 22:03.280
It's gotten much more troublesome since
Princess Sherwood moved here.

22:03.280 --> 22:07.530
Man, it's going to get busy around here.

22:12.930 --> 22:17.930
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:18.500 --> 22:26.440
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:29.010 --> 22:31.780
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:31.780 --> 22:34.510
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:34.520 --> 22:37.080
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:37.080 --> 22:39.720
Which one goes deeper?

22:39.720 --> 22:42.460
Roses fly from my head

22:42.460 --> 22:45.160
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:45.160 --> 22:47.760
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:47.760 --> 22:50.330
Blood that gushes away

22:50.400 --> 22:53.030
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:53.030 --> 22:55.700
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:55.700 --> 22:58.370
And yet you're still

22:58.370 --> 23:01.070
Seeking love?

23:01.080 --> 23:03.810
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:03.810 --> 23:06.480
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:06.480 --> 23:11.480
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:11.750 --> 23:16.750
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:17.190 --> 23:22.190
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:22.430 --> 23:25.130
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:25.130 --> 23:27.770
But if you still ask for it

23:27.770 --> 23:31.740
Your dying breath just might be

23:31.740 --> 23:40.020
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:41.450 --> 23:42.780
Huga.

23:42.780 --> 23:44.350
Huga, huga.

23:58.430 --> 23:59.770
Huga, huga, huga.

23:59.770 --> 24:00.670
Huga?

24:00.670 --> 24:01.870
That's right.

24:01.870 --> 24:05.170
Flandre, let me take you to the
beach one of these days.

24:05.170 --> 24:07.740
Next episode, "Princess Reminiscence"

24:07.740 --> 24:09.410
Huga, huga.
